            </note>
            <note corresp="#d845-f3" n="3" xml:id="d845-f3-content">
                <p>Telegram 88 from Tel Aviv, July 26, not printed, summarized a radio address
                    delivered on July 25 by Walter Eytan
                    concerning Israel’s attitude toward the possible British evacuation of Suez.
                    (641.71/7–2654)</p>
            </note>
